<Data>Data Flow Analysis : LTE_DL_4Ant_TxSpectrum Analysis&#x000D;&#x000A;9/6/2013..7:14 AM&#x000D;&#x000A;LTE_DL_MIMO_4Ant_Src_RangeCheck &apos;LTE_DL_4Ant_TxSpectrum__LTE_DL_MIMO_4Ant_Src.LTE_DL_MIMO_4Ant_Src_RangeCheck&apos;: &#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;System Configurations:&#x000D;&#x000A;1. Number of transmit antenna ports is 4.&#x000D;&#x000A;2. Frame structure is FDD.&#x000D;&#x000A;3. Channel bandwidth is 5 MHz.&#x000D;&#x000A;4. Cell ID is 0.&#x000D;&#x000A;5. Normal cyclic prefix is employed.&#x000D;&#x000A;6. Number of OFDM symbols used for transmission of PDCCHs of the 10 downlink subframes are {2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2}.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 1:&#x000D;&#x000A;1.HARQ closed-loop transmission is not enabled.&#x000D;&#x000A;2. The MIMO mode is spatial multiplexing (SM). Precoding with large-delay CDD is applied. According to 36.211, precoder index 0 is selected for 2 antenna ports, and precoder indices 12, 13, 14 and 15 are selected for 4 antenna ports.&#x000D;&#x000A;3. The number of code word(s) is 2; The number of layer(s) is 4&#x000D;&#x000A;4. For Codeword  1, transport block sizes of the 10 subframes are {7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992}.&#x000D;&#x000A;5. For Codeword  2, transport block sizes of the 10 subframes are {7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992, 7992}.&#x000D;&#x000A;6. For Codeword 1, modulation orders of the 10 subframes are {16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM}.&#x000D;&#x000A;7. For Codeword 2, modulation orders of the 10 subframes are {16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM, 16QAM}.&#x000D;&#x000A;8. Number of allocated resource blocks (RBs) of the 10 subframes are {25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25}.&#x000D;&#x000A;9. Number of symbols (resource elements (REs)) available for UE 1 of the 10 subframes are {2816, 3200, 3200, 3200, 3200, 3056, 3200, 3200, 3200, 3200}.&#x000D;&#x000A;10. For Codeword 1, number of channel bits for UE 1 of the 10 subframes are {11264, 12800, 12800, 12800, 12800, 12224, 12800, 12800, 12800, 12800}.&#x000D;&#x000A;11. For Codeword 2, number of channel bits for UE 1 of the 10 subframes are {11264, 12800, 12800, 12800, 12800, 12224, 12800, 12800, 12800, 12800}.&#x000D;&#x000A;12. For Codeword  1, code rates of the 10 subframes are {0.3548, 0.3122, 0.3122, 0.3122, 0.3122, 0.3269, 0.3122, 0.3122, 0.3122, 0.3122}.&#x000D;&#x000A;13. For Codeword  2, code rates of the 10 subframes are {0.3548, 0.3122, 0.3122, 0.3122, 0.3122, 0.3269, 0.3122, 0.3122, 0.3122, 0.3122}.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 2:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 3:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 4:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 5:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 6:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A;Execution time: 1.8968931137 sec&#x000D;&#x000A;</Data></Item></Item></Item>
